#TRACE `form 6.3 the person must appear for the purposes of considering an order under section 490.012` 21 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the offender` DOES `form 6.3 appears for the purposes of considering an order under subsection 490.012(1) to (3)` AT 21

#TRACE `form 6.3 the person must appear for the purposes of considering an order under section 490.012` 21 AT 0 WITH
